OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers in the north in
OL,6,Fthe morning, otherwise dry, bright.
OL,7,FShowers becoming more widespread in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon, some on the heavy side.
OL,9,FStrengthening southwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThere will be a mixture of
OL,12,Fclear spells and a few showers.
OL,13,FOvernight some more frequent showers
OL,14,Facross Argyll. A windy night.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FBright or sunny intervals and
OL,17,Fshowers, some heavy. Fresh to strong
OL,18,Fwesterly winds. Drier by evening. On
OL,19,Fthe cool side.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
